# The Knotty Kitewright: the kite shop under its gable with a loft, a pennant mast, and kites flying on strings above.
# Hand-placed by the landmark pass on the room's blocked back band and what lies behind it,
# so it never stands on a tile a knight walks or hides the floor from the camera.

# the shop and its loft
box    wood    at 100 0 -6 size 70 34 26 id lm-kite-shop
gable  roof    at 100 34 -6 size 78 20 32
box    wood    at 76 48 -8 size 18 14 16 id lm-kite-loft
pyramid roof    at 76 62 -8 size 22 10 20
# the pennant mast
cylinder-8 wood    at 292 0 -4 size 5 72 5 id lm-mast
box    plaster at 301 63 -4 size 16 6 1
box    slate   at 299 52 -4 size 12 5 1
# kites on their strings: a diamond, a tail of bows, and the string slanting down
